BARANGAY CERTIFICATIONS

REQUIREMENTS:

    A. Old residents: Valid ID and current community Tax Certificate (CTC)
    B. New residents: Registered on the Barangay Census, valid ID, CTC and endrsement from the house owner for boarders/transients

STEPS ON HOW TO GET BARANGAY CERTIFICATE:
    1. Go to Barangay Hall with the certification requirements and log in on the record book with the purpose to the Officer of the Day.
    2. Submit the requirements to Secretary for the preparation of the Barangay Certification.
    3. Punong Barangay will sign the prepared Barangay Certification and pay certification fee to the Treasurer the amount of ₱100.00(PHP) for the issuance of Official Receipt and release of the certification 
 